<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-AUSTRALIA BEAT ULSTER 39-26 IN TOUR MATCH.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-AUSTRALIA BEAT ULSTER 39-26 IN TOUR MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>BELFAST 1996-11-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat Ulster 39-26 (halftime 12-16) in their rugby union tour match on Saturday:</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Ulster - Tries: James Topping, penalty try. Penalties: Stuart Laing (4). Conversions: Stuart Laing (2).</p>
<p>Australia - Tries: Joseph Roff (2), John Eales, David Campese, penalty try. Penalties: Matthew Burke, David Knox. Conversions: Matthew Burke (4).</p>
<p>Attendance: 7,000.</p>
</text>
